  "claim": "borg_dimension_door() (borg-escape.c:569-621) takes the lowest borg_danger() grid of the in-bounds box with no check that the player can land there. The scan order makes the north-west-most zero-danger grid win, which on a rock level is unknown granite. effect_handler_TELEPORT_TO (effect-handler-general.c:2717-2843) never lands on an impassable or occupied grid: it searches outward from the target (has_teleport_destination_prereqs, effect-handler-general.c:132-157), so the Borg's score describes a grid it never reaches. The correction skips grids not known to be floor (or that are lava, or hold a known monster) before scoring.",
